# The turbo-relation default pattern evaluation fixture (docs/relation.md,
# "Measured defaults"). Written for this repository and licensed with it
# (Apache-2.0); no sentence comes from an outside corpus. Gold UD v2 parses,
# gold entity spans and kinds (`entity = first-last kind`, word numbers),
# and gold relations (`relation = head tail label`, entity numbers in
# entity order), one sentence per block. A sentence's text is its word
# forms joined by single spaces.

